Package: pedometerhomewidget
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Pedometer home widget on a hardware step counter
 Steps, distance and calories for today and for the week, the last seven
 days or all time, a daily goal and a seven-day chart, on the home screen
 of Maemo Leste. A port of Andrei Mirestean's Pedometer Home Widget for
 Maemo 5 that reads a hardware step counter instead of the accelerometer:
 the D-Bus service org.pro1x.Steps (pro1x-steps on the F(x)tec Pro1X). It
 only listens while it is visible, so it costs nothing in the pocket.
XB-Maemo-Display-Name: Pedometer
